      "title": "Outdoor CCTV & Perimeter Surveillance",
      "desc": "Provides reliable network connectivity for outdoor CCTV cameras and perimeter security systems, ensuring continuous video transmission from remote monitoring points. This enables centralized surveillance, real-time incident detection, and improved site security."
    },
    {
      "title": "Smart Transportation & Roadside Infrastructure",
      "desc": "Connects traffic signals, roadside sensors, surveillance cameras, and intelligent transportation systems through a dependable network infrastructure. This enables real-time traffic monitoring, coordinated control, and improved road safety and traffic management."
    },
    {
      "title": "Remote Outdoor Asset Connectivity",
      "desc": "Enables secure and reliable network access for outdoor assets deployed across remote or hard-to-reach locations. It allows operators to remotely monitor equipment, collect field data, and manage infrastructure without requiring on-site visits."
    }
